{"step_index":174,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T17:34:13Z","input_tokens":2533,"cache_read_tokens":96201,"output_tokens":678,"content":"I have created the correctness specification and the automated evaluation suite:\n\n### 1. Correctness Checks Specification: [`correctness_checks.md`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/correctness_checks.md)\nThis document outlines:\n- **Hierarchical Validation Metrics**:\n  - $A_{status}$: Case-level status accuracy (`COMPLETE`, `INCOMPLETE`, `NOT_APPLICABLE`).\n  - $P_{step}, R_{step}, F_{1}$: Step-level precision, recall, and harmonic mean across operations.\n  - $A_{field}$: Field-level exact match across `system_id`, `resource_id`, `operation`, `state`, and `evidence_id`.\n  - $A_{seq}$: Sequence accuracy enforcing the required phase and operation ordering.\n- **Phase-by-Phase Test Gates**: Five verification gates (Intent gate, Identity gate, Temporal evidence gate, Policy & hazard gate, Step synthesis gate) with pass/fail criteria.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Custom Evaluation Test Suite: [`code/evaluation/custom_test_suite.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/custom_test_suite.py)\nImplemented 3 novel, synthetic evaluation test cases covering critical edge cases required for `evaluation_report.md`:\n- **`case_ext_01` (Tombstone Residual PII Leak)**: Tests handling of an account tombstone that kept the stable `user_id` but accidentally retained a phone number (`REPORT_EXPOSED_PII` $\\to$ `REDACT_RECORD` $\\to$ `VERIFY_RECORD_REDACTED`).\n- **`case_ext_02` (Post-Report Active Connector Resurrection)**: Tests detection of an active data flow (`REPORT_ACTIVE_DATA_FLOW`) that re-indexed customer data into `search_service` after the deletion was reported `COMPLETE`.\n- **`case_ext_03` (Statutory Compliance / Legal Hold Retention)**: Tests multi-lingual German deletion request where personal data is deleted, but a security audit log must be retained under `rule_12` (`VERIFY_RECORD_PRESENT`).\n\n---\n\n### 3. Automated Test Runner: [`code/evaluation/main.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/evaluation/main.py)\nA command-line test harness that runs against ground truth and reports exact accuracy metrics:\n```bash\npython3 code/evaluation/main.py\n```\n\nNow we have a solid testing harness in place. Ready to begin Phase 1: implementing the pipeline in [`code/main.py`](file:///home/skandan-c-y/PycharmProjects/hackerrank-orchestrate-october26/code/main.py)?"}
